WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.270
This video covers finding your
way around a busy practice.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.670
The dashboard shows today's encounters.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.320
Filter to Unsigned to see
notes that still need your

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.790
review, and step through
the days with the arrows.

00:00:11.427 --> 00:00:13.977
Patients lists everyone in the practice.

00:00:14.387 --> 00:00:17.017
Filter to Recent, or search by name.

00:00:17.107 --> 00:00:19.347
Open a patient to see
their trends and Encounter

00:00:19.347 --> 00:00:22.297
History, with every past
visit one click away.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:25.980
While you review an encounter,
open Past Encounters to

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.010
check earlier visits,
and the note stays open.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:32.610
Search those visits for a finding,
such as the patient's weight.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.870
Press Command K to search encounters,

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.270
patients, and messages at once.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.870
Type a symptom or a detail,
and pick the visit you need.

00:00:42.427 --> 00:00:44.987
On the Practice page,
owners and admins see

00:00:44.987 --> 00:00:48.257
active members and their
roles, and pending invitations.

00:00:48.827 --> 00:00:52.337
Choose Invite member, enter
an email, and pick a role.

00:00:52.907 --> 00:00:56.097
In a practice, client messages
land in a shared inbox.

00:00:56.267 --> 00:00:58.987
Filter to Unassigned,
then assign a thread to

00:00:58.987 --> 00:01:01.297
a teammate, so everyone
knows who's answering.
